stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open: todos.add (no assignee)
    [*] --> InProgress: todos.add (with assignee)

    Open --> InProgress: todos.assign or todos.status
    Open --> Deferred: todos.status
    Open --> Completed: todos.status
    Open --> Archived: todos.status

    InProgress --> Open: todos.status
    InProgress --> Deferred: todos.status
    InProgress --> Completed: todos.status
    InProgress --> Archived: todos.status

    Deferred --> Open: todos.status
    Deferred --> InProgress: todos.assign or todos.status
    Deferred --> Completed: todos.status
    Deferred --> Archived: todos.status

    Completed --> Open: todos.status
    Completed --> InProgress: todos.status
    Completed --> Deferred: todos.status
    Completed --> Archived: todos.status or 28-day refresh

    Archived --> Open: todos.status
    Archived --> InProgress: todos.status

    state "SQLite Crash-Recovery Journal (sqlitejournal)" as Journal {
        [*] --> Pending: 1. Record source/target rev & paths
        Pending --> Committed: 2a. Create / Update / Move fsynced
        Pending --> Staged: 2b. Delete renamed to .trash/seq-file
        Staged --> Committed: 3. Unlink trash file & commit snapshot
    }
